  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Institutional strengthening Interamerican court of human rights - Interamerican court of human rights</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Institutionellt st&#xe4;rkande Interamerikanska domstolen f&#xf6;r m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen l&#xf6;per &#xf6;ver tre &#xe5;r, 2023-2025, med ett totalt belopp p&#xe5; 24 000 000 kr, och omfattar:

1) St&#xf6;d till domstolens r&#xe4;tteg&#xe5;ngsarbete under sessionsperioderna, samt till r&#xe4;ttsliga f&#xf6;rfaranden p&#xe5; plats i medlemsl&#xe4;nderna.

2) F&#xf6;rst&#xe4;rkning av informationshanteringen, inklusive informationss&#xe4;kerhet, samt st&#xf6;d till domstolens virtuella bibliotek.

3) F&#xf6;rst&#xe4;rkning av domstolens kursverksamhet

4) St&#xf6;d till arbetet med att informera om domstolens r&#xe4;ttspraxis, inklusive &#xf6;vers&#xe4;ttning av domar till engelska och portugisiska.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The support covers three years, 2023-2025, with a total amount of SEK 24 000 000, and aims at continuing the lines of work previously supported by Sweden, including:

1) Strengthening of the jurisdictional work of the Court by supporting the periods of sessions and carrying out legal proceedings in the member states.

2) Strengthening of information management including security of information and the resources of the Court and its library.

3) Strengthening of the training capacities of the Court.

4) Strengthening the work with dissemination of Court jurisprudence, including translation of key
decisions.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the intervention is to contribute to the institutional strengthening of the Inter American Court of Human Rights in order to improve the human rights situation in the States Parties to the American Convention of Human Rights. 

The objective will be achieve through 4 main outcomes: 

1. Strengthen the jurisdictional activity of the Inter-American Court by supporting the holding of sessions and the conduct of judicial proceedings in the States.

2. Strengthen the resources and computer security of the Inter-American Court and its Library.

3. Strengthen the human rights training capacities of the Inter-American Court.

4. Strengthen the dissemination of the work and jurisprudence of the Inter-American Court through the translation of key decisions.</narrative>
  </description>
